    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I haven’t personally used AI for math learning, but I’ve seen how tools like Wolfram Alpha break down solutions and explain steps interactively. The high openness score might make me more open to trying such tools if they bridge gaps between theory and practice—especially in fields where creativity in problem-solving is key.",
